    <string name="ecualizador_quick">Quick adjustments</string>
    <string name="ecualizador_protect">Protected bass</string>
    <string name="ecualizador_protect_help">Caps the bass and lowers the whole curve a little so it doesn\'t distort, then brings the volume back without clipping. Recommended: your car already has strong bass.</string>
    <string name="ecualizador_bass">Bass boost</string>
    <string name="ecualizador_voice">Vocal clarity</string>
    <string name="ecualizador_voice_help">Vocal clarity lifts voice presence (1 to 4 kHz) and removes the “mud” around 200 to 400 Hz.</string>

