    <string name="ecualizador_explain_title">What does this equalizer affect?</string>
    <string name="ecualizador_explain">Apps: Spotify, CarPlay with AutoKit, YouTube or NewPipe and USB music. FM radio and the screen\'s Bluetooth music go through the car\'s sound chip: for those, use the factory equalizer.</string>
    <string name="ecualizador_explain_tip">The factory one also adds to app sound: if you use both, keep the factory one flat or gentle so it doesn\'t distort.</string>
    <string name="ecualizador_factory_open">Open the factory equalizer</string>
